ACCEPTED LOCAL DISPOSITION,2026-09-24, before implementation. Architecture9.4,
Brief12.11 clauses1/2/3. No owner ruling. This derives bounded relational appraisals;
it creates no authoritative affection/respect/trust/comfort scalar state.

## Candidate appraisal semantics
At40 SplitLenses derives four independently optional unit values:
Affection=min(total assistance units/4,1), unknown without own incident history;
Respect=mean witnessed task successes, unknown without observed task opportunities;
Trust=mean fulfilled own commitments, unknown without own commitment opportunities;
Comfort=1-current observed looming-threat Boolean, unknown without current cue.
These are bounded benevolence/competence/reliability/safety appraisal proxies, not
general definitions of the emotions or learned trust calibration. A zero or unknown
respect/affection does not silently become contempt/dislike. Trust names expected
fulfillment of this controlled commitment class; comfort names present felt safety.

Freeze6 models: laws1..5 Goal1 and law1 Goal2. Freeze data-only model/run/experiment/
comparison identities before public execution. Require affection1/respect0, affection0/
respect1, trust1/comfort0; selective source changes; observer and target specificity;
same person estimate with different dyadic history; missing versus adverse evidence;
modifier-disabled distribution control; actual phase checks and single-score/person-only
competitors. Hidden truth/denied observations/nonrecipient changes must preserve whole
later views including common received observations, not just terminal lens values.
Restore and advance every complete prefix; fault all13 stages/commit after acquisition;
test cross-domain/observer/target authority and malformed model/input/save.
